abstract: >-
  Code, result tables, and per-row scores behind the paper "Measuring Student Profile
  Personalization in Instruction-Following Rerankers for University Course Question Answering". Six
  instruction-following rerankers were scored in a 2 x 2 design, a student profile in the instruction
  slot against a label line in the passage, on paired and broad tracks. One command recomputes the
  tables from the per-row scores and checks the paper's numbers. Chunk anchors, question texts, rebuild
  scripts, pinned model commits, and a small open-licensed demo pool let a reader run the scorers.
